{
  "bodyHash": "FkUPi5deweM=",
  "content": "你好世界<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模组包，倾心制作。整合 Serilum 的模组，方便下载！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>生活质量模组包</strong> 是一种特殊类型的模组，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>生活质量型</strong>模组合并为一个。虽然我发现将模组分组非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让它们更容易安装。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar）的系统。这基本上意味着包含的模组保持完全独立，同时允许像安装整合包一样进行捆绑安装。所有模组仍然拥有自己的配置文件，并且你会在游戏内的模组列表中看到它们全部列出。<br><br>该模组包是模组包开发的额外辅助工具，但并不会取代我个人更喜欢的模块化模组系统。不过，你可以通过模组包的配置文件禁用包含的模组。<strong>需要重启才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它兼容同时正常安装模组和捆绑包中包含的模组。这主要用于强制指定版本，但即使模组被意外安装两次也不会引起问题。虽然可能没问题，但当然最好只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此模组包，可以移除其中已包含的任何其他模组。<br><br>我希望这个模组包对你们中那些更喜欢大型内容模组的人有所帮助。非常感谢大家多年来的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端与服务器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p><details><summary>显示详细信息</summary><span><strong>enableAlwaysaWitherSkull</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableAutomaticDoors</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBetterBeaconPlacement</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBetterConduitPlacement</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBetterSpawnerControl</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBottledAir</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCompactHelpCommand</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableConduitsPreventDrowned</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCyclePaintings</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableDismountEntity</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableEasyElytraTakeoff</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableEnchantingCommands</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableExtendedBoneMeal</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFurnaceRecycle</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableHoeTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableInventoryTotem</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableKeepMySoilTilled</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableKelpFertilizer</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMoveBoats</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMoveMinecarts</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableNoAnimalTemptDelay</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableNoFeatherTrample</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableNutritiousMilk</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableOreHarvester</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableQuickPaths</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableQuickRightClick</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRecast</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableReplantingCrops</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRespawningShulkers</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableScaffoldingDropsNearby</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSleepSooner</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSofterHayBales</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableStackRefill</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableStickyEnchantingLapis</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSuperflatWorldNoSlimes</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSurfaceMushrooms</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableThornyBushProtection</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableTreeHarvester</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableUnderwaterEnchanting</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableVillageBellRecipe</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableWoolTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableYourItemsAreSafe</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableZombieProofDoors</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可用模组包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;以下 Serilum 模组包已可用：</p><table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 客户端模组包</a></td>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 自定义模组包</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 额外模组包</a></td>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 生活质量模组包</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum RPG 模组包</a></td>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 生成模组包</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"包含的模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/always-a-wither-skull.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/always-a-wither-skull\" target=\"_blank\">Always a Wither Skull（总是掉落凋灵骷髅头）</a></td>\r\n<td>让凋灵骷髅在死亡时必定掉落其头颅。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/automatic-doors.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/automatic-doors\" target=\"_blank\">Automatic Doors（自动门）</a></td>\r\n<td>自动打开玩家周围的门，并可在可配置的延迟后关闭。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-beacon-placement.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-beacon-placement\" target=\"_blank\">Better Beacon Placement（更好的信标放置）</a></td>\r\n<td>通过用矿物块右键点击信标，轻松放置信标基座。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-conduit-placement.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-conduit-placement\" target=\"_blank\">Better Conduit Placement（更好的潮涌核心放置）</a></td>\r\n<td>在面前放置潮涌核心，使放置海晶石块更容易，以及其他调整。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-spawner-control.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-spawner-control\" target=\"_blank\">Better Spawner Control（更好的刷怪笼控制）</a></td>\r\n<td>当刷怪笼被5个火把包围时，禁用该刷怪笼。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bottled-air.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bottled-air\" target=\"_blank\">Bottled Air（瓶装空气）</a></td>\r\n<td>允许玩家在水下用空玻璃瓶呼吸，获得更多氧气。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/compact-help-command.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/compact-help-command\" target=\"_blank\">Compact Help Command（精简帮助命令）</a></td>\r\n<td>修改 /help 命令，使其显示所有信息、色彩丰富且支持多页。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/conduits-prevent-drowned.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/conduits-prevent-drowned\" target=\"_blank\">Conduits Prevent Drowned（潮涌核心阻止溺尸）</a></td>\r\n<td>当潮涌能量状态效果激活时，禁用玩家周围的溺尸僵尸生成。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/cycle-paintings.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cycle-paintings\" target=\"_blank\">Cycle Paintings（循环绘画）</a></td>\r\n<td>通过手持另一幅画右键点击已放置的画，轻松循环切换。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/dismount-entity.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dismount-entity\" target=\"_blank\">Dismount Entity（卸下实体）</a></td>\r\n<td>允许玩家从被骑乘的实体上卸下/移除/离开实体/生物，而无需破坏它们。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/easy-elytra-takeoff.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-elytra-takeoff\" target=\"_blank\">Easy Elytra Takeoff（轻松鞘翅起飞）</a></td>\r\n<td>允许在地面使用烟花直接从鞘翅/Colytra起飞，无需跳跃。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/enchanting-commands.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanting-commands\" target=\"_blank\">Enchanting Commands（附魔命令）</a></td>\r\n<td>通过命令轻松创建（模组化）附魔物品，等级可超过默认上限。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/extended-bone-meal.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/extended-bone-meal\" target=\"_blank\">Extended Bone Meal（扩展骨粉）</a></td>\r\n<td>扩展骨粉功能。潜行时瞬间生长，可催熟下界疣、仙人掌、甘蔗及其他调整。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/furnace-recycle.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/furnace-recycle\" target=\"_blank\">Furnace Recycle（熔炉回收）</a></td>\r\n<td>所有含金属的物品都可在熔炉中回收并返回原材料。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hoe-tweaks.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hoe-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\">Hoe Tweaks（锄头调整）</a></td>\r\n<td>更快的作物方块破坏速度，更大的锄头作用半径，以及将耕地恢复为泥土的能力。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/inventory-totem.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/inventory-totem\" target=\"_blank\">Inventory Totem（背包不死图腾）</a></td>\r\n<td>使不死图腾的效果在背包任何位置时都能生效。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/keep-my-soil-tilled.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/keep-my-soil-tilled\" target=\"_blank\">Keep My Soil Tilled（保持耕地）</a></td>\r\n<td>在收获后，保持茎秆方块（西瓜/南瓜）下方的耕地处于耕种状态。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/kelp-fertilizer.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/kelp-fertilizer\" target=\"_blank\">Kelp Fertilizer（海带肥料）</a></td>\r\n<td>海带自然过滤海水以获取丰富养分。海带可像骨粉一样使用。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/move-boats.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/move-boats\" target=\"_blank\">Move Boats（移动船只）</a></td>\r\n<td>允许玩家轻松移动船只而无需破坏它们。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/move-minecarts.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/move-minecarts\" target=\"_blank\">Move Minecarts（移动矿车）</a></td>\r\n<td>轻松拾起并移动矿车，无需破坏它们。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/no-animal-tempt-delay.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/no-animal-tempt-delay\" target=\"_blank\">No Animal Tempt Delay（无动物吸引冷却）</a></td>\r\n<td>移除试图用动物喜好的食物吸引它们时的冷却时间。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/no-feather-trample.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/no-feather-trample\" target=\"_blank\">No Feather Trample（无羽毛践踏）</a></td>\r\n<td>拥有缓降效果时，防止耕地方块被踩踏。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/nutritious-milk.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/nutritious-milk\" target=\"_blank\">Nutritious Milk（营养牛奶）</a></td>\r\n<td>为牛奶添加营养价值，饮用后可补充食物条和饱和度。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/ore-harvester.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ore-harvester\" target=\"_blank\">Ore Harvester（矿石收获者）</a></td>\r\n<td>瞬间收获整个矿脉，并将矿石物品掉落至初始方块位置。是连锁挖矿模组的更新替代方案。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/quick-paths.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/quick-paths\" target=\"_blank\">Quick Paths（快速路径）</a></td>\r\n<td>通过设置起点和终点，瞬间创建长路径。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/quick-right-click.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/quick-right-click\" target=\"_blank\">Quick Right-Click（快速右键）</a></td>\r\n<td>为某些物品添加便携功能，无需放置即可快速访问。适用于床、工作台、末影箱和潜影盒等。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/recast.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/recast\" target=\"_blank\">Recast（自动抛竿）</a></td>\r\n<td>当玩家钓到物品时，自动重新抛出钓鱼竿。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/replanting-crops.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/replanting-crops\" target=\"_blank\">Replanting Crops（自动补种）</a></td>\r\n<td>使用锄头收获作物后，利用掉落物自动重新种植/替换/播种。适用于模组化掉落物、胡萝卜、土豆、甜菜根、下界疣、可可豆和小麦。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/respawning-shulkers.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/respawning-shulkers\" target=\"_blank\">Respawning Shulkers（潜影贝重生）</a></td>\r\n<td>潜影贝将在死亡位置经过可配置的延迟后重生，可持续获取外壳。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/scaffolding-drops-nearby.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/scaffolding-drops-nearby\" target=\"_blank\">Scaffolding Drops Nearby（脚手架就近掉落）</a></td>\r\n<td>破坏脚手架方块时，所有连锁方块将在该方块位置掉落。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/sleep-sooner.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sleep-sooner\" target=\"_blank\">Sleep Sooner（更早入睡）</a></td>\r\n<td>也可以更晚入睡！让玩家在不同时间上床睡觉。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/softer-hay-bales.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/softer-hay-bales\" target=\"_blank\">Softer Hay Bales（柔软干草捆）</a></td>\r\n<td>使干草捆完全抵消掉落伤害，如同《刺客信条》风格。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/stack-refill.gif\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/stack-refill\" target=\"_blank\">Stack Refill（自动补充堆叠）</a></td>\r\n<td>使用最后一个物品时，若存在替换品，自动补充玩家手中的物品。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/sticky-enchanting-lapis.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sticky-enchanting-lapis\" target=\"_blank\">Sticky Enchanting Lapis（附魔台留青金石）</a></td>\r\n<td>允许青金石留在附魔台中，并可在玩家之间共享。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/superflat-world-no-slimes.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/superflat-world-no-slimes\" target=\"_blank\">Superflat World No Slimes（超平坦世界无史莱姆）</a></td>\r\n<td>在超平坦世界中尝试创造时，移除那些烦人的史莱姆。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/surface-mushrooms.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/surface-mushrooms\" target=\"_blank\">Surface Mushrooms（地表蘑菇）</a></td>\r\n<td>蘑菇可在白天地表及任何亮度下放置。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/thorny-bush-protection.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thorny-bush-protection\" target=\"_blank\">Thorny Bush Protection（浆果丛防护）</a></td>\r\n<td>穿着护腿时，玩家穿过浆果丛不会受到伤害。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/tree-harvester.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tree-harvester\" target=\"_blank\">Tree Harvester（树木收获者）</a></td>\r\n<td>用斧头瞬间收获整棵树和巨型蘑菇。包括快速树叶腐烂和树苗放置。也适用于诡异（下界）树木。快速成为砍树大师。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/underwater-enchanting.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/underwater-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\">Underwater Enchanting（水下附魔）</a></td>\r\n<td>允许在水下使用附魔台，并通过书架达到最高等级。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/village-bell-recipe.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/village-bell-recipe\" target=\"_blank\">Village Bell Recipe（村庄钟配方）</a></td>\r\n<td>为村庄钟添加可合成的配方。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/wool-tweaks.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wool-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\">Wool Tweaks（羊毛调整）</a></td>\r\n<td>对羊毛类方块配方、线转换和染色过程进行各种修改。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/your-items-are-safe.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/your-items-are-safe\" target=\"_blank\">Your Items Are Safe（你的物品安全）</a></td>\r\n<td>死亡时生成一个装有玩家物品的箱子和盔甲架，作为墓碑的替代方案。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-proof-doors.png\"></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombie-proof-doors\" target=\"_blank\">Zombie Proof Doors（僵尸防砸门）</a></td>\r\n<td>阻止僵尸瞄准并破坏门。</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何模组包中自由使用此模组包，前提是下载文件仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
